summary: Tests that confirms kernel task stack overflow, underflow and scribbling is handled gracefully
description: |
  Memory Mamagement Risk Assesment test that check what happens with a kernel task that perform
  a stack overflow, underflow and scribbling (writing to random places in the stack)
contact: <pablmart@redhat.com>
id: a9cf65c2-fb45-461d-a697-5cd1b99fc158
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: beakerlib
require:
  - make
  - gcc
  - type: file
    pattern:
      - /kernel-include
      - /memory/mmra/userspace-stack-overflow-underflow-scribbling/stacklib.c
duration: 10m
restart-on-exit-code:
    - 255
restart-max-count: 3
